# Firebase Admin service-account credentials — these are secrets. The full
# JSON contents go in the FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON env var on the
# server, never in the repo. Note: google-services.json (the CLIENT
# identifier in android/app/) is intentionally NOT ignored — the gradle
# plugin needs it at build time.
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
firebase-service-account*.json
serviceAccountKey.json